module fan-out
edition 0
needs console and tasks


to fetch name (text) d giving text, needs tasks, may fail with not-found:
    sleep for d
    if name equals "missing":
        give back problem not-found
    give back "{name} ok"


to gather of names (a list of text) giving a list of text, needs tasks, may fail with not-found and several and timed-out:
    within 5 seconds:
        give back each n in names at the same time, fetch(n, 1 second)
    give back []


to race giving a list of text, needs tasks, may fail with not-found and several and timed-out:
    within 3 seconds:
        give back all of:
            fetch("slow", 1 minute)
            fetch("fast", 1 second)
    give back []


to main, needs console and tasks, may fail with not-found and several and timed-out:
    let parts be all of:
        weather: fetch("weather", 2 seconds)
        rates: fetch("rates", 1 second)
    show parts's weather
    show parts's rates
    show gather of ["a", "b"]
    let one be gather of ["a", "missing"]
    show one's kind
    let late be race()
    show late's kind
